{
  "_readme": "Charts for the Attribute Listing tool (Scavengers chapter). Each chart is a thing, its attributes, and the options for each attribute, as in the book's restaurant chart. `source` says where a chart comes from: 'book' means the headings and options are the book's (restaurant: the book's chart plus one added option; pen: the book names the attributes, the options are ours), 'new' means written for this site at Mark's direction (2026-11-07) and needs his review. `start` is the index of the ordinary option in each attribute, so the tool opens on the plain version of the thing. Keep 4 to 6 attributes and 5 to 7 options each, with at least one odd option per attribute.",
